:: Tavern Rumors
<<if $gold >= 2>>
<<set $gold -= 2>>

You buy an ale and settle in. The villagers speak in hushed tones. Over the next hour, you piece together several rumors:

- "The wolves started appearing a month ago. Right after those green lights showed up in the deep forest."
- "Old Garrett says he saw someone -- or something -- moving near the Keep ruins at midnight."
- "Mara's been acting strange. She won't go near the forest anymore. Not since her husband died there thirty years ago."
- "Some say the shrine in the clearing is cursed. Others say it's blessed. Depends who you ask."

You've spent 2 gold. Gold remaining: $gold.

[[Leave the tavern|Town Square]]
<<else>>
You're too broke for a drink. Come back when you have 2 gold.
[[Back|Tavern]]
<</if>>
